          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2024-01-01",
          "end": "2024-12-31"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2025-01-01",
          "end": "2025-12-31"
        },
        "value": "2.75",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C2",
      "text": "Net interest income increased by 3.09% from $92,583 million in 2024 to $95,443 million in 2025, driven by higher Markets net interest income, higher revolving balances in PRODUCT_26, higher wholesale deposit balances, and the impact of investment securities activity, partially offset by deposit margin compression and the impact of lower rates.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0005_E01",
        "EP_0005_E02"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0005_F04",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0005_F03",
        "metric": "net_interest_income",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2024-01-01",
          "end": "2024-12-31"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2025-01-01",
          "end": "2025-12-31"
        },
        "value": "3.09",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C3",
      "text": "Noninterest revenue increased by 2.39% from $84,973 million in 2024 to $87,004 million in 2025, despite a decrease in other income due to the absence of a $7.9 billion net gain related to ENTITY_04 shares recorded in 2024.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0005_E01",
        "EP_0005_E02"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0005_F06",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0005_F05",
        "metric": "noninterest_revenue",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2024-01-01",
          "end": "2024-12-31"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2025-01-01",
          "end": "2025-12-31"
        },
        "value": "2.39",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "C4",
      "text": "The provision for credit losses increased significantly by 33.09% from $10,678 million in 2024 to $14,212 million in 2025, primarily due to increases in both consumer and wholesale credit losses.",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "EP_0005_E04"
      ],
      "check_spec": {
        "kind": "percentage_change",
        "from_fact_id": "EP_0005_F08",
        "to_fact_id": "EP_0005_F07",
        "metric": "provision_for_credit_losses",
        "from_period": {
          "label": "FY2024",
          "start": "2024-01-01",
          "end": "2024-12-31"
        },
        "to_period": {
          "label": "FY2025",
          "start": "2025-01-01",
          "end": "2025-12-31"
        },
        "value": "33.09",
        "unit": "percent"
      }
    }
  ],
  "rationale": "COMPANY_05 shows modest revenue growth, with both net interest income and noninterest revenue contributing to the increase. However, this positive trend is significantly offset by a substantial increase in the provision for credit losses, indicating potential deterioration in credit quality or a more conservative outlook. The increase in credit losses, particularly in consumer and wholesale segments, presents a material risk. Given the mixed signals of revenue growth alongside rising credit loss provisions, a HOLD recommendation is appropriate as the company navigates these challenges."
}

